{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_sqrrel_set_2_story_2",
  "groupId": "story_sqrrel_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Flammables",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_sqrrel_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b39709351d2e7cf6cbfaac4089a084947b1de3fcb73360ec746028fc9a7fed27",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shaw's Work Log\nJan 5 \\ Overcast\nThere was a fire at a residential building downtown."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Everyone, don'tpanic! Pleasefollowourinstructions andevacuatetooutside thecordonedoffarea. Donotpanic..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It's gone... My life savings... all gone..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hahaha... That's what I'm talking about! Burn this whole stinking place to the ground! Hahahaha..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "M-Mommy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Clear a path! Use triage! Care for the heavily injured first!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "*cough*, *cough* *cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Are the residents all clear?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Chief, no sign of anyone still trapped."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Girl",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Mommy!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Resident",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Mio!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "*Sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Everyone, please take a look around and see if there's anyone you know who hasn't evacuated?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Resident",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Has anyone seen the weird guy who lives on the second floor...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Male Resident",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Right, now that you mention it, I don't think I've seen him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "The second floor? Isn't that where the fire started?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "That doesn’t sound good. Do you know if he's home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Resident",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I... I don’t know..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Girl",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I do!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Girl",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "He leaves his blinds open every time he goes out, but his blinds were closed when I came down the stairs just now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Well, crap..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Hey! Hey—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Tell HQ! There's someone trapped inside. The fire has grown so big that the firefighters can't go back in. Send fire trucks. Right now—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Letmego! I'llfigureoutaway togetthisguyout!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Don't be ridiculous! That's suicide!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "The fire’s probably from an Originium fire starter explosion. It might set off a chain reaction any minutet—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Soit'sallthemoredangerous foranyonestuckinside!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "But––"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Notimetohesitate, Chief!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I'verescuedmorethanoneperson trappedinafire! Pleasetrustme!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Stay in contact... and be careful."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Comms",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Shaw, how’s it going in there...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I'vemadeitinside. Thefire'sburning ataround450degrees."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It'sanoldresidentialbuilding. Reinforcedconceretestructure. Ifwedon'tputthefireoutsoon, itmaynotbeable tosustainitsload!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Thefiredoesn'tseemtohavespreadto thefirstflooryet, butthesmokehere isverythick."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I'vereachedthefireescape. Nowproceedingtothefirstfloor."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Comms",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Roger that. Be careful."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Comms",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Shaw, give me a status report."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "*Cough*... There’saverythick layerofsmoke onthefirstfloor... Thesecondfloor mightbeevenworse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Anyonewho'sstillinside isinseriousdanger. Igottahurry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Ican'tseeverywell..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Comms",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Shaw, don't push yourself. If you can't get inside, come back down right away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Chief, thefireescape canstillbeused! I'mproceedingtothesecondfl—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Comms",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Shaw!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "*Cough*... I'mfine, Chief! Justashelffalling."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(Igottamakeapointofthis inmynextfiresafetylecture. Youcan'tputallthisstuff nexttoafireexit.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Comms",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Be careful..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Help... Help... me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Oh! Chief, Iheardsomeone calloutforhelp justnow!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Overthere!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It'sthisflathere!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Help... help me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Sir? Icanhearyou!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Please, coveryourmouthandnose. Don'ttalkandsaveyourstrength! I'llfindaway togetyouout!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The tiny Zalak slams on the burning hot steel door with her shoulder. It doesn't bulge."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(Crap, thedoorframe'sstartedtodeform becauseoftheheat!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(Let'sseeifIcancutitopen withmyaxe.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Sir, stayawayfromthedoor, please! Watchout!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hyah—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It'sworking! Icandothis!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sparks fly everywhere. Shaw's axe turns scalding hot from the heat of the fire.\nShe tightly grips her axe's handle and slams it toward the door's lock. The fissure on the lock is already clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Almostthere..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Gottafightthefire..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Gotta... Gotta... fightthefire..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Gottasaveeveryone..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Shaw?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Shaw, Shaw! Wake up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Isthefireout—?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Shaw!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "You scared the hell out of me. I’m glad you’re awake..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "H-How'sthefire?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Don't move!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "And don't worry. The fire's out. You did great."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "But now I’m worried about you. The medic says you breathed in a little too much carbon monoxide. You need to get some rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Don't move too much, and keep your oxygen mask on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Oh, wait! Whataboutthatguy?! Whathappened totheguywhowastrapped inthebuilding?! Igotta—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Shaw!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Chief, Icanstill—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "It's too late."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shaw never expected to find such a small room behind the door.\nEverything inside has been burned to ashes, which in turn makes the room look that much more open.\nThere is a safe in the corner of the room. Although warped from the heat, its contents are miraculously intact.\nA small stack of LMD bills and a stamp album."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Shaw."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Pack it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The fire erupted so quickly. In the end, one person died, with eleven in critical condition.\nThat was the first time I saw a life extinguished right before my eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jan 8 \\ Showers\nI found a pet fowlbeast.\nI got distracted during training; got reprimanded. Had to write a self-reflection report."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jan 11 \\ Clear\nThe investigation into the fire the other day has wrapped up. It was started by a worn-out home-use Originium fire starter device, which set off a chain of explosions. The residents had too many things strewn around the building, which helped the fire spread.\nI was commended at the ceremony today."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jan 13 \\ Overcast\nI took the day off."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Y-Yousaidyoucouldn'tfindanything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Right. You were there yourself. His whole life was burned to a crisp. There weren't any clues for us to work with."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "We asked around in the neighborhood. All we learned is that the deceased was a single male. No idea what he did for a living or what his relationships were like."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Whatabouthisfamily? Hisfamilyhastoknow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "We put a notice in the papers asking anyone to come forward to claim his remains. We still haven't heard from anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Butwhat... whatifhisfamilydidn'tseeit? Whatifhedoesn'thaveanyfamily inLungmen...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "That's not something we have to worry about."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wecan'tbeoutofideasnow...\nThat'sright, hisstampalbum!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Wasn'tthereastampalbum inhisroom?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Oh, that thing, huh? We looked into it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "No idea why he kept it in the safe, but analysis shows it's just a normal stamp album. There aren't even any fingerprints. We couldn't find any leads at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Why are you still asking about the fire, Shaw? The investigation must be over by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "It was a home-use Originium fire starter that burned the place down. Both the L.G.D. and fire department arrived at that conclusion. There's nothing suspicious about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Chief... I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Chief... mayIhavethestampalbum?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "If we go by the book, we're supposed to destroy all personal effects left behind by nameless victims. I could give it to you, but what for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Chief... There'ssomethingveryimportant thatIgottafigureout. Idunnohowtoexplain, but—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "*Sigh*, what do I do with you... Come with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Thanks!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Male Resident",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "The guy who lived on the second floor? Didn't you ask me just a couple days ago? I didn't know him!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Male Resident",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Every time I had to see that shitty face of his, it was all I could do to keep from punching it in. He never gave anyone the time of day. Why would we care about him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Male Resident",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Look, half my flat got burned down. I don't have the time to worry about some guy. I'm busy. Now leave me alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Sorrytobotheryou..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Resident",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "There aren’t many of us in this building, so we all know each other, more or less..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Resident",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "But that guy never talked to anyone. He never left his room during the day, either, so nobody knew much about him..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Girl",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I met that uncle once. He was really big! He was like thiiiiiis tall!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Girl",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "He smiled at me and gave me a candy, too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Little Girl",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Huh? Was he an uncle or a grandpa? I'm not too sure..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Resident",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Mio! How many times have I told you not to accept things from strangers?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Resident",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I'm sorry, we can't help you. We have some errands to run. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Sorryforinterruptingyou, thankyouverymuch, goodbye!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Stillnoideawhohewas..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jan 15 \\ Overcast\nI took the day off.\nI talked to a lot of people, but no one knew anything about the man.\nIt was like the fire burned away every trace of his life, like he never existed at all.\nNo, this isn't in my job description. I can't write about this here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "...Pleaseholdon!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hello, sorryforinterrupting, doyouwork atthepostoffice? CanIaskyousomething?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Takealook atthisstampalbum!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Oh? If you want an appraisal on your collectibles, you need to make a reservation with the postal collectible specialists, and I'm about to clock out..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "No, that'snotit! I'mverysorry, Ijustwantedtoask, wouldyoubeable totellanythingaboutitsowner justbylooking atthestampalbum?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What do you mean by that... It's not yours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "No... ActuallyIguessitkindofis. Anyway, couldyoupleasetakealook? It'sreallyimportant..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Alright, alright. Slow down. Hand it over."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hm... You don't see a collection like this very often."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Didyoufigureoutsomething?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Not really. It's just strange. Why would someone collect stamps like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "W-Whatdoyoumean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "When people collect stamps, they’re usually either limited edition stamps or stamps that have some special significance, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "But the stamps in here are all very common. There's no value in it whatsoever."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Novalue? Butitsowner keptitverysafe..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I can't tell you what the collector was thinking. The stamps' themes and years are all jumbled up, and he kept both postmarked and non-postmarked stamps together..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "A lot of it has Kou-wu landscapes, though. Look, from this page onwards, it's all Kou-wu sceneries."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Now this 'Hui-ch'i Foothills' one is a classic. If my memory serves, it was issued a couple decades ago? They printed a lot of them, though, so it's not worth that much money."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "That aside, I couldn’t tell you what's so special about this collection."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Isthatall...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "If you wanted to learn something about the owner from the collection, I'm afraid there's not much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "If I had to give you an answer, maybe he likes the landscapes in Kou-wu?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Gotit... Thanksalot!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Kou-wu landscapes..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Washe... fromKou-wu?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "'Kou-wuKitchen...' Thisisit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Come in, come in. Take a seat anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hellothere... Iamwondering... ifyouserveauthentic Kou-wunesecuisinehere?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What? Girl, go ahead and ask every restaurant in Lungmen. See if anyone dares to say they serve more authentic Kou-wunese food than me?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I-I'msorry, that'snotwhatImeant!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "WhatImeanttoaskis... dopeoplefromKou-wu eathereoften?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "People from Kou-wu? Of course. We've served many Kou-wunese expats here. All of them say our food takes them right back home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "If you don't believe me, why don’t you try it yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Boss... Iwanttoaskyouaboutacustomer..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "He... HewasprobablyKou-wuese... Areallytallman, andprobablykindofhardup. Heprobablylookedalittleangry... maybenot... buthewouldcomefodinner intheevenings, otherwisealwayskeepingtohimself..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "MaybeI'mnotexplainingitclearly... butdoesthatringanybells?! Evenasmallcluewillhelp!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "You said... it was a tall guy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "That rings a bell... Yes, it does. There's a customer like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Doyouknowhim?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Yeah... He’s a regular, sort of."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It's just like you said. He always comes by himself, and always around midnight just before closing. I always have to stick around an extra hour for him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "He never orders much, either. Just a finbeast and a small side dish. A thing of liquor, too. He hangs around a little after he's done before heading on home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Yeah, he looks real scary, but he's not a bad fella. Helps me clean up once he's done, too. Sometimes he talks about home when he's had a little too much to drink."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Boss... Doyouknow... ifhehasanyfriendsorfamily?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Friends or family? He never told me about them, but he certainly doesn't seem like he's married."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "If you want to know, I could ask him for you next time? Wait, no, this is a customer's privacy we're talking about... *Sigh*... You'll just have to ask him yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Boss, couldyoutellmemore... aboutthiscustomer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Heprobably... won'tbebackagain..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Won't be back again? No way. He loves my food. He's one of the ones I was talking about, always saying my cooking reminds them of home."
