    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "You're right, though. I haven’t seen him in a while..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I wonder what that young man's been up to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "H-Holdonasecond!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "D-Didyoujustsay... youngman?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Right, he's a young man. Maybe a little older than you, but probably not by much."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Post Office Worker",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Now this 'Hui-ch'i Foothills' one is a classic. If my memory serves, it was issued a couple decades ago?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hey, hey now, girl. Why are you crying, all of a sudden? A-Are you looking for family?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "A-Alright, the next time he shows up, I'll ask him every last detail. Don't cry, okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hey, speak of the devil. Now you pop in, eh, kid? Look at this girl, she's been asking after you, even started crying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Restaurant Owner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I have no idea what's going on, but help me out here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I-It'syou...!"
