    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "This brings me back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "'Hui-ch'i Foothills...' I grew up in a small town at the base of Mount Hui-ch'i. A place just like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "I even remember this small pond behind the mountain. All the finbeasts we ate when I was a kid were from there."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "You can buy the freshest fins at the docks here, but there aren't any great fishing spots like that pond."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "It's been years since I've been home, but the place still looks just as lovely as always, at least on these stamps."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Doyouthinkthatman wenttotheseplaces?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Hard to say..."
