    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Shaw, I'll say this no matter how many times it takes. You've done your job. Under those circumstances, no one could've done better, not even you yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "I can't tell you that's a wrong way to think, but with this kind of baggage, can you really throw yourself into the next fire without hesitating?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I... I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Shaw, it wasn’t your fault."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Alright, I've said enough. This is something you have to figure out. I’m in no position to lecture you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senior L.G.D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "It's chilly tonight. Head home soon."
