    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shaw's Work Log\nJan 16 \\ Overcast\nToday's the last day of my vacation. I did something really embarrassing.\nIn the end, I couldn't find anything about the man. I don't know what to do to pull myself together, but I still have more important work.\nJan 17 \\ Clear\nToday's my first day back on the job.\nI've fallen behind on my training, so I gotta catch up. I might've caught a cold, and I need to get better!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "SoIjustdemonstratedthedangers thatyoureverydayfirestarters mightpose."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Theexamplewetalkedabout isn'tjusttheory. Therewasafire justliketheoneItalkedabout inLungmentwoyearsago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Wemustalwayskeepinmind howtoproperlyescape thesceneofafire, butintheend, themosteffectivewaytofightfires isbypreventingthemfromhappening inthefirstplace."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "UnlikeCatastrophes, it'susuallypeople whostartfires, butittakesmorethan ourwillpoweralone tostopfires."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Wecanstopanaccident atitssource, butonceatragedystrikes, there'snoturningthingsaround nomatterhowremorsefulwefeel."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ifrit",
      "speakerId": "char_134_ifrit",
      "text": "Hey, Skyfire. Is it just me or did the squirt sound like she was kinda nervous that whole talk?"
