      "text": "W-WasItalkingtoofast?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Don'tbenervous, don'tbenervous... *phew*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shaw",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "*Cough*... S-Sowejusttalkedabout firestarteraccidents, buttherearemanyotherways afirecanstart."
